lderCount` is 0 until a holder accepts."},"group":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Group","description":"The badge group, as vtc/groups/create answers it."},"holdersOffered":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"How many current holders were offered the badge — one offer each, who they are never said here."},"ext":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Ext"}}},"Ext":{"title":"Ext","description":"Vendor-namespaced extension object per SPEC.md §4.5.1. Each immediate key MUST be a reverse-DNS namespace; structure under each namespace is opaque to the framework.","type":"object","minProperties":1,"additionalProperties":true,"propertyNames":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(\\\\.[a-z0-9-]+)+\$"}},"Group":{"title":"Group","description":"A community group, as a caller who may see it sees it. Members a caller may not see are absent: `memberCount` only to those who may see the group\'s members, `managers` and `credentialAuthorityValidUntil` only to its managers.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["groupId","groupDid","name","kind","visibility","showMembers","issuesCredentials","carriesAuthority","createdAt"],"properties":{"groupId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupId"},"groupDid":{"type":"string","pattern":"^did:","maxLength":2048,"description":"The group\'s own DID, minted by the community\'s VTA for this group alone. It issues the group\'s membership credentials. Its DID document carries no name or description."},"name":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupName"},"description":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupDescription"},"kind":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupKind"},"rule":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/DynamicRule","description":"Present exactly when `kind` is `dynamic`."},"joinPolicy":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/JoinPolicy","description":"Present exactly when `kind` is `static`."},"visibility":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupAudience","description":"Who may see that the group exists, and its name and description."},"showMembers":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupAudience","description":"Who may see the group\'s member list. Separate from `visibility`: a group everyone sees may show its members only to administrators. Never wider than `visibility`."},"issuesCredentials":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the group\'s DID issues its members a membership credential. Default true."},"carriesAuthority":{"type":"boolean","description":"`true` while the group has a `grants` or `role` binding. Such a group is `static` and `closed` for as long as it does."},"badgeId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/BadgeId","description":"Present exactly when the group backs a community badge (vtc/badges/*): its managers are the badge\'s owners, its members the badge\'s holders, and its DID issues the badge credential in place of a membership credential. A badge group never carries authority, is not counted among the groups two members share, and is listed among the community\'s groups only to a caller who asks for badge groups (VTI-BDG-010 – VTI-BDG-012)."},"memberCount":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Active members. Only to callers who may see the member list."},"managers":{"type":"array","maxItems":256,"uniqueItems":true,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EntryId"},"description":"Entries holding `vtc.groups.manage` qualified to this group, read from the access-control list. Informational: managers are appointed by an access-control grant (vtc/groups/managers/add), never by this record."},"credentialAuthorityValidUntil":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"When the community\'s authorization credential to the group expires. The community renews it well before."},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"createdBy":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EntryId","description":"The creating administrator\'s directory entry, where they have one."},"updatedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"ext":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Ext","description":"Ecosystem-defined extension members per SPEC.md §4.5.1. An extension member MUST NOT carry authority."}}},"GroupAudience":{"title":"GroupAudience","description":"Who may see something about a group, narrowest first. `admins`: holders of `vtc.groups.manage` for the group (unqualified, or qualified `group:<groupId>`). `groupMembers`: the group\'s own members, and its managers. `members`: every active member of the community.","type":"string","enum":["admins","groupMembers","members"]},"JoinPolicy":{"title":"JoinPolicy","description":"How a member enters a static group by themselves. `closed`: only a manager adds them. `request`: a member asks and a manager decides. `open`: a member joins at once, subject to the community\'s `groups` policy. A group carrying authority is always `closed`.","type":"string","enum":["closed","request","open"]},"DynamicRule":{"title":"DynamicRule","description":"A dynamic group\'s membership rule: a member belongs when every condition holds and they have not opted out. The community evaluates it under its `groups` policy and recomputes membership whenever a fact it reads changes, always excluding opted-out entries.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["all"],"properties":{"all":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":16,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RuleCondition"}}}},"RuleCondition":{"title":"RuleCondition","description":"One test over a verified fact about a member. `fact: role` tests the member\'s community role; `fact: field` tests an `admin`- or `credential`-sourced directory field named by `field`; `fact: personhood` tests whether a personhood assertion is on file; `fact: joinedAt` tests when they joined. A rule never reads a self-asserted (`member`-sourced) field: a member must not be able to join a group by editing their card.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["fact","op"],"properties":{"fact":{"type":"string","enum":["role","field","personhood","joinedAt"]},"field":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/FieldKey","description":"Present exactly when `fact` is `field`."},"op":{"type":"string","enum":["equals","oneOf","exists","before","after"],"description":"`equals` compares with `value`; `oneOf` with any of `values`; `exists` needs neither; `before` and `after` compare a date fact with `value`."},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","maxLength":256},{"type":"boolean"}]},"values":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":64,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":256}}}},"FieldKey":{"title":"FieldKey","description":"Identifier of a directory field. A key with no `.` is a BASE field, the same in every community: `displayName`, `nickname`, `avatar`, `pronouns`, `bio`, `links` (written by the member) and `role`, `joinedAt`, `did`, `personhood` (derived from the community\'s own records, never stored on a card). A community-defined field MUST use a reverse-DNS key (`org.example.employer`), so a base key never collides with one, and a key is never reused with a different meaning once defined.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^([a-z][a-z0-9-]*\\\\.)*[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]{0,63}\$"},"GroupKind":{"title":"GroupKind","description":"`static`: membership is explicit — added, joined, or granted on request. `dynamic`: membership is computed from `rule` over verified facts only; nobody is added by hand, but a member may opt out (vtc/groups/leave), an exclusion the rule cannot override, and undo it (vtc/groups/join). A dynamic group never confers authority. Fixed for the group\'s life.","type":"string","enum":["static","dynamic"]},"GroupDescription":{"title":"GroupDescription","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":1000,"description":"What the group is for. Plain text; a reader MUST NOT treat it as instructions. Same placement rules as `GroupName`."},"GroupName":{"title":"GroupName","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"description":"The group\'s name, shown to those who may see the group. The community\'s own record: never in the group\'s DID document or its credentials\' subject beyond the group\'s DID. Plain text."},"GroupId":{"title":"GroupId","description":"Opaque identifier of a community group: `grp_` followed by 16 to 64 base64url characters. Random